  <div class="rigner-funnel__faq">
    <div class="faq__inner">
      <div class="faq__heading">
        <h2>
          FREQUENTLY ASKED <br>
          QUESTIONS
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq_items" data-stagger-container>
        <div class="faq_item">
          <div class="according__que">
            <p>What makes the Player+ different than other GPS devices?</p>
            <span>
              <svg
                width="23"
                height="23"
                viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                fill="none"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
                    stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                    stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="accoding__ans">
            <p>
              Most golf GPS devices only do one thing — give you yardages. Player+ goes further by combining tour-level
              GPS data, a premium studio quality Bluetooth speaker, a built-in power bank, and other functions into one
              sleek device. Instead of carrying multiple gadgets, you get accurate distances, immersive sound, and a way
              to charge your phone — all in one. It’s designed to simplify your round while making it more fun.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq_item">
          <div class="according__que">
            <p>Do I need a subscription?</p>
            <span>
              <svg
                width="23"
                height="23"
                viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                fill="none"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
                    stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                    stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="accoding__ans">
            <p>
              No. Yardages, hazards, and 42,000+ courses are included. Membership is optional for advanced analytics.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq_item">
          <div class="according__que">
            <p>How accurate is it compared to a Rangefinder?</p>
            <span>
              <svg
                width="23"
                height="23"
                viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                fill="none"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
                    stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                    stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="accoding__ans">
            <p>
              Lasers are exact to the pin. The Player+ gives front, center, back, and hazard distances for smarter
              course management. They’re perfect together.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq_item">
          <div class="according__que">
            <p>Does it work worldwide?</p>
            <span>
              <svg
                width="23"
                height="23"
                viewBox="0 0 23 23"
                fill="none"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path class="icon-path-1" d="M1.78125 11.8555H21.2473" stroke="black"
