                    stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="accoding__ans">
            <p>
              Phone apps drain battery, distract you with notifications, and rely on less accurate GPS. Player+ is
              purpose-built for golf: it delivers precise yardages, lasts a full round, and automatically tracks your
              stats with the GAME app—plus it doubles as a premium speaker, so you get music and performance in one
              device.
            </p>
          </div>
